  <h1 class="ciq-page-title">About ComplianceIQ</h1>

  <p>ComplianceIQ is an enterprise compliance knowledge base demonstrating <a href="https://scolta.io" class="ciq-link">Scolta</a> semantic search across regulatory content.</p>

  <section class="ciq-listing-section">
    <h2 class="ciq-section-header">What's Inside</h2>
    <ul class="ciq-item-list">
      <li class="ciq-item-list__item"><strong>Regulation Sections</strong> — Primary text from GDPR, HIPAA, CCPA/CPRA, SOX, PCI-DSS, FERPA, ADA/Section 508, and FedRAMP.</li>
      <li class="ciq-item-list__item"><strong>Guidance Articles</strong> — Plain-language explanations for Legal, IT, and Executive audiences.</li>
      <li class="ciq-item-list__item"><strong>Enforcement Cases</strong> — ICO, HHS OCR, and FTC enforcement actions with penalty amounts and lessons learned.</li>
      <li class="ciq-item-list__item"><strong>Checklists</strong> — Role-based and regulation-based compliance checklists.</li>
      <li class="ciq-item-list__item"><strong>Comparisons</strong> — Cross-regulation comparison pages.</li>
      <li class="ciq-item-list__item"><strong>Glossary</strong> — Compliance terminology with regulation-specific definitions.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="ciq-listing-section">
    <h2 class="ciq-section-header">How Scolta Works</h2>
    <p>When you search, Scolta expands your query with semantically related compliance terms. Searching "hacked" automatically surfaces results for "breach", "unauthorized access", "security incident", and "notification obligation" — across all relevant regulations simultaneously.</p>
  </section>

